### List products
GET https://api.example.com/products?limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Create an order
POST https://api.example.com/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "sku": "EXAMPLE-001", "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "shipping": {
    "method": "standard"
  }
}

### Read order status
GET https://api.example.com/orders/example-order
Accept: application/json
